%% YorkLanes — checklist import sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web as apps/web
  participant API as apps/api
  participant Py as checklist-parser
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres

  User->>Web: POST /api/plans/import (multipart PDF)
  Web->>API: proxy + session cookie
  API->>API: requireAuth
  API->>Py: spawn parse_checklist.py (temp file)
  Py-->>API: stdout JSON courses + sections
  API->>API: inferChecklistMetadata + planGenerator
  API->>DB: INSERT degree_plans, plan_terms, plan_courses
  DB-->>API: plan id
  API-->>Web: 201 { plan, parsed, inferred }
  Web-->>User: redirect /plan?id=uuid
  User->>Web: GET /plan?id=uuid (SSR)
  Web->>API: GET /api/plans/:id/graph
  API->>DB: JOIN courses, prerequisites
  DB-->>API: graph JSON
  API-->>Web: graph
  Web-->>User: HTML + plan-editor.ts interactivity
